<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.3.7">
<l>akkarai yeṉṉu maṉattak kaṭalu ḷaḻuntiyuṉ pēraruḷāl</l>
<l>ikkarai yēṟiyi ḷaittirun tēṉaiyañ cēleṉṟu kaikaviyāy</l>
<l>cakkara muntaṭak kaikaḷuṅ kaṇkaḷum pītaka vāṭaiyoṭuñ</l>
<l>cekkar niṟattuc civappuṭai yāytiru māliruñ cōlaiyentāy</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Saying, “Do not fear”, you extend your hand to me who,</l>
<l rend="indent">having sunk in the ocean of futility called the further shore,</l>
<l>by the grace of your name,</l>
<l rend="indent"> climbed, exhausted to this shore.</l>
<l>My Father in Tirumāliruñcōlai,</l>
<l rend="indent">you who has the discus, broad hands and eyes,</l>
<l rend="indent">a golden garment, and a red hue the colour of the red sky.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
